Third-party programs shipped in the Ubuntu package
===================================================

These binaries are installed under /usr/lib/continuum-vpn/bin and are started
only by Continuum VPN. Versions are pinned in ubuntu/versions.env.

shadowsocks-rust (sslocal)
  Upstream: https://github.com/shadowsocks/shadowsocks-rust
  Version: v1.25.0
  License: MIT

wg-obfuscator
  Upstream: https://github.com/ClusterM/wg-obfuscator
  Version: v1.6
  License: GPL-3.0-only
  Corresponding source: https://github.com/ClusterM/wg-obfuscator/tree/v1.6
  The GPL license text is installed beside this notice as wg-obfuscator-LICENSE.
  Continuum VPN runs this program as a separate process.

udp2raw
  Upstream: https://github.com/wangyu-/udp2raw
  Version: 20230206.0
  License: MIT
